00010 * ORDENTRY - order entry DSPF36 member, production style (DSP-05, RV-41)
00020 * Three formats: header, detail line, confirmation. Written by hand from
00030 * SC41-4730 Appendix B, not a real member: replace it with one if you can.
00040 * === ORDHDR: customer and order number ===
00050SORDHDR     1  YN    Y                                    3
00060DTITLE     11 135N                                 ORDER ENTRY
00070D          11 3 5N                                 CUSTOMER NO
00080DCUSTNO     6 320N  YS
00090D          11 4 5N                                 ORDER DATE
00100DORDDAT     6 420N  YS
00110D          11 5 5N                                 CUST NAME
00120DCUSTNM    30 520Y
00130D          11 7 5N                                 SHIP VIA
00140DSHIPVA     2 720N  Y
00150DERRMSG    6023 241
00160D          4224 2N                                 ENTER=CONTINUE   CMD3=EX
00170 ND   CMD12=CANCEL
00180 * === ORDDET: detail line: input, protected and message fields ===
00190SORDDET     1  YN  Y
00200D          11 132N                                 ORDER LINE
00210D          11 4 5N                                 ITEM NUMBER
00220DITEMNO     8 420N  Y
00230D          11 5 5N                                 DESCRIPTION
00240DITEMDS    30 520Y
00250D          11 6 5N                                 QUANTITY
00260DQTY        5 620N  YS
00270D          11 7 5N                                 UNIT PRICE
00280DPRICE      7 720Y  YS
00290DMSG1      4022 2Y                                M0001U1
00300 * === ORDCNF: output fields, a constant shown when indicator 50 is off ===
00310SORDCNF     1
00320D          18 3 5N                                 ORDER ACCEPTED NO.
00330DORDNO      6 325Y   S
00340DCNFTXT    20 5 550                                ORDER ON CREDIT HOLD
